      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Examples",
        "body": "The linked example is a separate graph. Inspect its relevant nodes and relationships; this specification does not embed or execute the example.\n\nEvery primitive's page is kept current this way: the root announces `graph.changed`, an `invokes` edge runs the Method that assembles the page, and the Method writes the three faces it declared.",
