      "data": {
        "title": "Where this lives",
        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/eventBridge.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/eventDelivery.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/changeAnnouncements.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/nodeChangeEvents.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/graphStructureEvents.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/eventDelivery.test.js`\n- `tests/changeAnnouncements.test.js`\n- `tests/nodeChangeEvents.test.js`\n- `tests/graphStructureEvents.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
